<title>SOUTH KOREA: Tong Yang Confectionery '96 net rises.</title>
<headline>Tong Yang Confectionery '96 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	 (billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)			1,617     vs	    763</p>
<p>    Net				    6.73  vs	   3.25</p>
<p>    Pre-tax net			  9.18  vs	   4.93</p>
<p>    Turnover			   372.98  vs	 336.72</p>
<p>Dividend in stock (pct, par 5,000 won)</p>
<p>			 common	   15.0   vs    10.0</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gain		 0.58  vs     2.61</p>
<p>Note - Tong Yang Confectionery Co is one of South Korea's largest confectionery companies.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5644</p>
</text>
